"Save"=="保存"
Autocrawler==自动爬虫
Autocrawler automatically selects and adds tasks to the local crawl queue. This will work best when there are already quite a few domains in the index.==自动爬虫会自动选择任务并将其添加到本地爬虫队列中。当索引中已经有相当多的域时，这种方法效果最佳。
Autocralwer Configuration==自动爬虫配置
You need to restart for some settings to be applied==你需要重新启动才能应用一些设置
Enable Autocrawler:==启用自动爬虫:
Deep crawl every Nth document:==每第 N 个文档进行深度爬取：
Warning: if this is bigger than "Rows to fetch" only shallow crawls will run.==警告：如果该值大于“要获取的行数”，则只会运行浅层爬网。
Rows to fetch at once:==一次取回行:
Recrawl only older than # days:==重新爬取只有 # 天以前的时间:
Get hosts by query:==通过查询获取服务器:
Can be any valid Solr query.==可以是任何有效的Solr查询。
Shallow crawl depth (0 to 2):==浅爬取深度（0至2）:
Deep crawl depth (1 to 5):==深度爬取深度（1至5）:
Index text:==索引文本:
Index media:==索引媒体:
