Knowledge Loader==知识加载器
YaCy can use external libraries to enable or enhance some functions. These libraries are not==你可以使用外部插件来增强一些功能. 考虑到程序大小问题,
included in the main release of YaCy because they would increase the application file too much.==这些插件并未被包含在主程序中.
You can download additional files here.==你可以在这下载扩展文件.
Geolocalization==地理定位
Geolocalization will enable YaCy to present locations from OpenStreetMap according to given search words.==根据关键字, YaCy能从OpenStreetMap获得的位置信息.
GeoNames==地名
With this file it is possible to find cities all over the world.==使用此文件可以找到世界各地的城市。
Content==内容
cities with a population &gt; 1000 all over the world==全世界人口为 &gt; 1000 的城市
Download from==下载自
Storage location==存放地点
Status==地位
not loaded==未加载
loaded==已加载
deactivated==无效
Action==动作
Result==结果
loaded and activated dictionary file==加载并激活字典文件
deactivated and removed dictionary file==停用并删除字典文件
deactivated dictionary file==停用的字典文件
activated dictionary file==激活字典文件
cities with a population &gt; 5000 all over the world==全世界人口为 &gt; 5000 的城市
cities with a population &gt; 100000 all over the world (the set is is reduced to cities &gt; 100000)==全球人口为 &gt; 100000 的城市（集合缩减为城市 &gt; 100000）
OpenGeoDB==开放地理数据库
With this file it is possible to find locations in Germany using the location (city) name, a zip code, a car sign or a telephone pre-dial number.==通过此文件，可以使用位置（城市）名称、邮政编码、汽车标志或电话预拨号码查找德国的位置。
Downloaded from==下载自
loaded - can be upgraded using the Load button for the new URL==已加载 - 可以使用“加载”按钮升级新的 URL
loaded and upgraded dictionary file==加载并升级的字典文件
Suggestions==建议
Suggestion dictionaries will help YaCy to provide better suggestions during the input of search words==建议词典将帮助YaCy在输入搜索词时提供更好的建议
DeReWo - Korpusbasierte Grund-/Wortformenlisten (German) of 'Institut f&uuml;r Deutsche Sprache'==DeReWo - “Institut f&uuml;r Deutsche Sprache”的 Korpusbasierte Grund-/Wortformenlisten（德语）
This file provides 100000 most common german words for suggestions==此文件提供 100000 个最常见的德语单词供建议
Synonyms==同义词
Synonyms are used to find not only the searched word but also their synonyms. This is done by adding all synonyms of words in documents to the document and searching the synonyms as well.==同义词不仅用于查找搜索词，还用于查找其同义词。这是通过将文档中单词的所有同义词添加到文档并搜索同义词来完成的。
OpenThesaurus - German Thesaurus from http://www.openthesaurus.de==OpenThesaurus - 来自 http://www.openthesaurus.de 的德语同义词库
The data from this source was converted to the YaCy synonym file format and part of the YaCy distribution.==来自此源的数据已转换为 YaCy 同义词文件格式和 YaCy 发行版的一部分。
Deactivated==已停用
Activated==活性
Moby Lexicon - English Thesaurus from https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/3202==Moby Lexicon - 来自 https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/3202 的英语同义词库
Russian Thesaurus==俄语同义词库
The data was converted to the YaCy synonym file format and part of the YaCy distribution.==数据已转换为 YaCy 同义词文件格式和 YaCy 发行版的一部分。
