#File: IndexFederated_p.html
#---------------------------
"Set"=="设置"
Index Sources &amp; Targets==索引来源&目标
YaCy supports multiple index storage locations.==YaCy支持多地索引储存。
As an internal indexing database a deep-embedded multi-core Solr is used and it is possible to attach also a remote Solr.==内部索引数据库使用了深度嵌入式多核Solr，并且还可以附加远端Solr。
Solr Search Index==Solr 搜索索引
Lazy Value Initialization==惰性值初始化
If checked, only non-zero values and non-empty strings are written to Solr fields.==如果选中，则仅将非零值和非空字符串写入 Solr 字段。
Use deep-embedded local Solr==使用深层嵌入的本地 Solr
This will write the YaCy-embedded Solr index which is stored within the YaCy DATA directory.==这将写入存储在YaCy的DATA目录下的 YaCy嵌入式Solr索引。
The Solr native search interface is accessible at==Solr 本机搜索界面可访问
/solr/select?q=*:*&amp;start=0&amp;rows=3&amp;core=collection1==/solr/select?q=*:*&amp;start=0&amp;行=3&amp;core=集合1
for the default search index (core: collection1) and at==对于默认搜索索引（核心：collection1）和at
If you switch off this index, a remote Solr must be activated.==如果关闭此索引，则必须激活远程 Solr。
Use remote Solr server(s)==使用远程 Solr 服务器
This external Solr can be used instead of the internal Solr. It can also be used additionally to the internal Solr, then both Solr indexes are mirrored.==可以使用此外部 Solr 代替内部 Solr。它还可以附加地用于内部 Solr，然后两个 Solr 索引都会被镜像。
Allow self-signed certificates==允许自签名证书
Tick this when the remote Solr server is password protected and is requested over HTTPS but provides only a self-signed certificate (not a validated one by an official Certificate Authority). The Solr URL could be for example something like <i>https://user:password@localhost:8984/solr</i>.==当远程 Solr 服务器受密码保护并且通过 HTTPS 请求但仅提供自签名证书（不是由官方证书颁发机构验证的证书）时，请勾选此选项。例如，Solr URL 可以是类似 <i>https://user:password@localhost:8984/solr</i> 的东西。
Solr Hosts==Solr 主持人
Solr Host Administration Interface==Solr 主机管理界面
Index Size==索引大小
Solr URL(s)==Solr URL(s)
You can set one or more Solr targets here which are accessed as a shard. For several targets, list them using a ',' (comma) as separator.==您可以在此处设置一个或多个 Solr 目标，这些目标作为分片进行访问。对于多个目标，请使用“,”（逗号）作为分隔符列出它们。
The set of remote targets are used as shards of a complete index. The host part of the url is used as key for a hash function which selects one of the shards (one of your remote servers).==远程目标集用作完整索引的分片。 url 的主机部分用作哈希函数的键，该函数选择一个分片（远程服务器之一）。
When a search request is made, all servers are accessed synchronously and the result is combined.==当发出搜索请求时，会同步访问所有服务器并合并结果。
Sharding Method==分片方式
write-enabled (if unchecked, the remote server(s) will only be used as search peers)==启用写入（如果未选中，远程服务器将仅用作搜索节点）
Web Structure Index==网络结构图索引
The web structure index is used for host browsing (to discover the internal file/folder structure), ranking (counting the number of references) and file search (there are about forty times more links from loaded pages than in documents of the main search index).==Web结构索引用于主机浏览（发现内部文件/folder结构）、排名（计算引用数量）和文件搜索（来自加载页面的链接比主搜索索引的文档中的链接多大约四十倍）。
use citation reference index (lightweight and fast)==使用引文参考索引（轻量且快速）
use webgraph search index (rich information in second Solr core)==使用网图搜索索引（第二个Solr核心中的丰富信息）
Peer-to-Peer Operation==P2P运行
The 'RWI' (Reverse Word Index) is necessary for index transmission in distributed mode. For portal or intranet mode this must be switched off.=='RWI'（反向词索引）对于分布式模式下的索引传输是必需的。在门户或内网模式下，必须将其关闭。
support peer-to-peer index transmission (DHT RWI index)==支持点对点索引传输（DHT RWI索引）
Block known error URLs in DHT==阻止 DHT 中的已知错误 URL
Reject URLs/RWIs with known errors from peers. Disable to opt out.==拒绝同行中存在已知错误的 URL/RWIs。禁用选择退出。
Retry after (days)==（天）后重试
for temporary errors; permanent errors stay blocked.==对于临时错误；永久错误将被阻止。
Permanent error statuses==永久错误状态
comma-separated (default: 404,410,-1; -1=DNS/network errors)==以逗号分隔（默认值：404,410,-1; -1=DNS/network 错误）
#-----------------------------

