"info"=="信息"
LLM Selection==LLM 选择
Here you can pick models from an LLM model service to select them as production model.==你可以在这里从 LLM 模型服务中选择模型，并将其作为工作模型使用。
In the "Production Models Matrix" you can then assign each selected model a function inside YaCy==随后可在“工作模型矩阵”中为每个选定模型分配 YaCy 内部功能
Service Selection==服务选择
service==服务
Ollama==Ollama
LMStudio==LM工作室
OpenAI==OpenAI
Open Router==打开路由器
This makes a preset to the Hoststub value==这会预设 Hoststub 值
hoststub==hoststub
you can probably leave this to the default value==您可以将其保留为默认值
api_key==api_key
(not required for Ollama or LMStudio)==（Ollama 或 LMStudio 不需要）
Services==服务
<b>num_ctx</b> is the context window (in tokens) of the inference service &mdash; a per-service==<b>num_ctx</b> 是推理服务 &mdash; 每个服务的上下文窗口（以标记为单位）
value, shared by all models on that endpoint. It is the total budget for prompt <i>plus</i>==值，由该端点上的所有模型共享。这是提示 <i>plus</i> 的总预算
generated output; YaCy uses it to size prompts so they leave room to generate. The row for the==生成的输出； YaCy 使用它来调整提示大小，以便为生成留出空间。该行为
service selected above appears here automatically with its stored (or default) window.==上面选择的服务及其存储（或默认）窗口自动出现在此处。
This value is <b>advisory</b>: set it to match the window your backend actually serves==该值为 <b>advisory</b>：将其设置为与后端实际服务的窗口相匹配
Context Length setting). YaCy does not enforce it on the backend.==上下文长度设置）。 YaCy 不会在后端强制执行。
num_ctx==num_ctx
Model Downloads==模型下载
Production Models Matrix==工作模型矩阵
model==模型
max_tokens==最大令牌数
search-answers==搜索答案
This model creates answers for search requests==该模型为搜索请求创建答案
chat==聊天
This model is used in the chat interface and as default for the RAG proxy==该模型用于聊天界面，并作为 RAG 代理的默认模型
translation==翻译
This model can be used to make translations of the web UI==该模型可用于翻译 Web UI
classification==分类
This model is used to classify prompts to find out what they demand==该模型用于对提示进行分类，找出他们的需求
search-query==search-query
This model produces search queries to YaCy search from prompts in RAG or chat==此模型根据 RAG 或聊天中的提示生成对 YaCy 搜索的搜索查询
qa-pairs==问答对
This model can be used to produce query-answer pairs which enhance search from chat prompts==该模型可用于生成查询-答案对，从而增强聊天提示的搜索
tldr-shortener==tldr-缩短剂
This model is used to make summaries from web content==该模型用于对网页内容进行摘要
log-report==日志报告
This model evaluates YaCy runtime logs and creates self-enhancement reports==该模型评估 YaCy 运行时日志并创建自我增强报告
thinking==思维
we detect thinking only to be able to suppress thinking. thinking is not used in YaCy==我们发现思考只是为了能够抑制思考。 YaCy 中不使用思维
tooling==工装
tooling is required for agentic abilities.==代理能力需要工具。
vision==想象
this enables image recognition in the chat==这可以在聊天中进行图像识别
format==格式
this is required for classification==这是分类所必需的
Actions==行动
