<abbr title="Mebibyte">MiB</abbr>. Disable crawls when used space is over.==<abbr title="Mebibyte">MiB</abbr>。当已用空间超过该值时禁用抓取。
Absolute maximum==绝对最大值
<abbr title="Mebibyte">MiB</abbr>. Disable <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr>-in when used space is over.==<abbr title="Mebibyte">MiB</abbr>。当已用空间超过该值时禁用 <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr>-in。
when absolute maximum limit has been reached.==当达到绝对最大限制值时。
The autoregulation task performs the following sequence of operations, stopping once used space disk is below the steady-state value:==自动调节任务执行以下操作序列，一旦使用的硬盘空间低于稳态值就停止：
<abbr title="Random Access Memory">RAM</abbr>==<abbr title="Random Access Memory">RAM</abbr>
