Peer names must not contain characters other than (a-z, A-Z, 0-9, '-', '_') and must not be longer than 80 characters.==对等名称不得包含 (a-z、A-Z、0-9、'-'、'_') 以外的字符，且长度不得超过 80 个字符。
Seed Upload method was changed successfully.==seed上传方式改变成功.
