#File: Settings_Debug.inc
#---------------------------
"Extensible Markup Language"=="可扩展标记语言"
"Distributed Hash Table"=="分布式哈希表"
"Reverse Word Index"=="反向词索引"
"Submit"=="提交"
Debug/Analysis Settings==调试/Analysis 设置
Be careful with these advanced settings, they can deeply affect the search process! You probably don't need to modify them for normal use.==请小心这些高级设置，它们会深刻影响搜索过程！您可能不需要修改它们即可正常使用。
Solr communication==Solr 通讯
Enable remote Solr binary responses==启用远程 Solr 二进制响应
When checked (default), responses from remote Solr index instances are transferred using an efficient binary data format.==选中后（默认），来自远程 Solr 索引实例的响应将使用高效的二进制数据格式进行传输。
When unchecked, responses are transferred as <abbr title="Extensible Markup Language">XML</abbr>,==未选中时，响应将传输为 <abbr title="Extensible Markup Language">XML</abbr>，
which can be captured and parsed by any external XML aware tool for debug/analysis.==可以由任何外部 XML 感知工具捕获和解析以进行调试/analysis.
Search data sources==搜索数据源
By default all data sources are enabled to obtain search results,==默认情况下启用所有数据源获取搜索结果，
but you can here disable one or more ones to check the behavior of the process.==但您可以在此处禁用一个或多个来检查进程的行为。
Local <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr>/<abbr title="Reverse Word Index">RWI</abbr>==本地 <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr>/<abbr title="Reverse Word Index">RWI</abbr>
Local Solr index==本地 Solr 索引
Remote <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr>/<abbr title="Reverse Word Index">RWI</abbr>==远程 <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr>/<abbr title="Reverse Word Index">RWI</abbr>
Remote Solr indexes==远程 Solr 索引
Search testing tweaks==搜索测试调整
Override <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr> peers selection by local only==仅覆盖本地的 <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr> 对等点选择
When checked, the remote <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr> peers selection is overridden and only the local peer is selected to provide remote DHT search results.==选中后，远程 <abbr title="Distributed Hash Table">DHT</abbr> 对等点选择将被覆盖，并且仅选择本地对等点来提供远程 DHT 搜索结果。
Override Solr peers selection by local only==仅覆盖本地的 Solr 对等点选择
When checked, the remote Solr peers selection is overridden and only this peer is selected to provide remote Solr search results.==选中后，远程 Solr 对等点选择将被覆盖，并且仅选择此对等点来提供远程 Solr 搜索结果。
Ranking information==排名信息
Show search results scores==显示搜索结果分数
When checked, the raw ranking score value is displayed for each text search result in the HTML results page.==选中后，将在 HTML 结果页面中显示每个文本搜索结果的原始排名分数值。
Text snippets statistics==文本片段统计
Enable text snippets statistics==启用文本片段统计
<em id="submitInfo">Changes will take effect immediately.</em>==<em id="submitInfo">更改将立即生效。</em>
#-----------------------------

#File: Settings_HttpClient.inc
#---------------------------
"Transport Layer Security"=="传输层安全"
"Server Name Indication"=="服务器名称指示"
"Submit"=="提交"
HTTP client settings==HTTP 客户端设置
You can configure here some advanced settings of the clients used by YaCy to handle outgoing HTTP connections.==您可以在此处配置 YaCy 用于处理传出 HTTP 连接的客户端的一些高级设置。
About Server Name Indication (SNI):==关于服务器名称指示 (SNI)：
this extension to the <abbr title="Transport Layer Security">TLS</abbr> protocol must be enabled to load some https URLs (for websites deployed with different certificates and host names on the same shared IP address), otherwise loading fails with errors such as==必须启用 <abbr title="Transport Layer Security">TLS</abbr> 协议的此扩展才能加载某些 https URL（对于在同一共享 IP 地址上部署有不同证书和主机名的网站），否则加载会失败并出现以下错误
Received fatal alert: handshake_failure==收到致命警报：handshake_failure
But it can be necessary to disable it in order to load some https URLs served by old and misconfigured web servers, otherwise loading fails with the exception==但可能需要禁用它才能加载旧的和配置错误的 Web 服务器提供的某些 https URL，否则加载会失败并出现异常
javax.net.ssl.SSLProtocolException: "handshake alert:  unrecognized_name"==javax.net.ssl.SSLProtocolException：“握手警报：无法识别的名称”
Controlling <abbr title="Server Name Indication">SNI</abbr> extension activation can also be done with the JVM option==还可以使用 JVM 选项来控制 <abbr title="Server Name Indication">SNI</abbr> 扩展激活
jsse.enableSNIExtension==jsse.enableSNI扩展
, but in that case a server restart is required when you want to modify the setting and it is not customizable per http client (general or for remote Solr).==，但在这种情况下，当您想要修改设置时，需要重新启动服务器，并且每个 http 客户端都不能自定义该设置（一般或远程 Solr）。
General HTTP client==一般 HTTP 客户端
Configuration settings for the main HTTP client, used notably to crawl websites and communicate with other YaCy peers.==主 HTTP 客户端的配置设置，主要用于抓取网站并与其他 YaCy 对等方进行通信。
Enable <abbr title="Server Name Indication">SNI</abbr> extension to <abbr title="Transport Layer Security">TLS</abbr>==启用 <abbr title="Server Name Indication">SNI</abbr> 扩展至 <abbr title="Transport Layer Security">TLS</abbr>
Remote Solr HTTP client==远程 Solr HTTP 客户端
Configuration settings for the specific HTTP client dedicated to communications with remote Solr servers (located on other YaCy peers or eventually owned by this one when it is configured to use a remote Solr index).==专用于与远程 Solr 服务器通信的特定 HTTP 客户端的配置设置（位于其他 YaCy 对等点上，或者当配置为使用远程 Solr 索引时最终由该服务器拥有）。
<em id="submitInfo">Changes will take effect immediately.</em>==<em id="submitInfo">更改将立即生效。</em>
#-----------------------------

