#File: Settings_Proxy.inc
#---------------------------
"Submit"=="提交"
Remote Proxy (optional)==远端代理（可选）
YaCy can use another proxy to connect to the internet. You can enter the address for the remote proxy here:==YaCy能够通过第二代理连接到网络, 在此输入远端代理地址.
Use remote proxy==使用远程代理
Enables the usage of the remote proxy by yacy==打开以支持远端代理
Use remote proxy for HTTPS==为HTTPS使用远端代理
Specifies if YaCy should forward ssl connections to the remote proxy.==选此指定YaCy是否使用SSL代理.
Remote proxy host==远端代理服务器
The ip address or domain name of the remote proxy==远端代理的IP地址或者域名
Remote proxy port==远端代理端口
the port of the remote proxy==远端代理使用的端口
Remote proxy user==远端代理用户
Remote proxy password==远端代理用户密码
No-proxy addresses==无代理地址
IP addresses for which the remote proxy should not be used==指定不使用代理的IP地址
Changes will take effect immediately.==改变立即生效.
#-----------------------------

#File: Settings_ProxyAccess.inc
#---------------------------
"Submit"=="提交"
"change"=="改变"
Proxy Settings==代理设置
Transparent Proxy==透明代理
With this you can specify if YaCy can be used as transparent proxy.==通过此您可以指定 YaCy 是否可以用作透明代理。
<em>Hint: On linux you can configure your firewall to transparently redirect all http traffic through yacy using this iptables rule</em>:==<em>提示：在 Linux 上，您可以使用此 iptables 规则</em> 配置防火墙以透明地重定向通过 yacy 的所有 http 流量：
Always Fresh==永远新鲜
If unchecked, the proxy will act using Cache Fresh / Cache Stale rules. If checked, the cache is always fresh which means==如果未选中，代理将使用“缓存新鲜”/“缓存陈旧”规则进行操作。如果选中，缓存始终是新鲜的，这意味着
that a page is never loaded again if it was already stored in the cache. However, if the page does not exist in the cache, it will be loaded in any case.==如果页面已经存储在缓存中，则永远不会再次加载该页面。但是，如果缓存中不存在该页面，则无论如何都会加载该页面。
Send "Via" Header==发送“通过”标头
http header according to RFC 2616 Sect 14.45.==根据 RFC 2616 第 14.45 节的 http 标头。
Send "X-Forwarded-For" Header==发送“X-Forwarded-For”标头
Specifies if the proxy should send the X-Forwarded-For http header.==指定代理是否应发送 X-Forwarded-For http 标头。
Proxy Access Settings==代理访问设置
These settings configure the access method to your own http proxy and server.==设定http代理和服务器的访问方式.
All traffic is routed through one single port, for both proxy and server.==代理和服务器流量均从同一端口流过.
HTTPS Server Port:==HTTPS 服务器端口：
Server Access Restrictions==服务器访问限制
define an <em>access domain</em> with a list of granted client IP-numbers or with wildcards==定义一个带有授权IP名单或者通配符的<em>访问域</em>
You probably don't want to share the proxy to the internet, so you should set the==如果不想在互联网上共享代理,
IP-Number Access Domain to a pattern that corresponds to you local intranet.==请定义一个对应本地局域网的IP访问域表达式.
IP-Number filter==IP地址过滤
Accounts==账户
#-----------------------------

#File: Settings_Referrer.inc
#---------------------------
"'Referer' section from the standard IETF specification"=="标准 IETF 规范中的“Referer”部分"
"Link types section at W3C HTML specification"=="W3C HTML 规范中的链接类型部分"
"Submit"=="提交"
Referrer Policy Settings==推荐人策略设置
When loading pages and navigating through links, a web browser sends some information about the origin of the request,==当加载页面并通过链接导航时，网络浏览器会发送一些有关请求来源的信息，
Visited websites can process this information as they wish, so this can become a privacy concern, for example when coming from a page which contains searched terms in its URL.==访问的网站可以按照自己的意愿处理这些信息，因此这可能会成为隐私问题，例如当来自在 URL 中包含搜索词的页面时。
This page offers some configuration settings to instruct your browser how it should fill this referrer information.==此页面提供了一些配置设置来指示您的浏览器应如何填充此引荐来源网址信息。
Beware that every browser behaves differently: some settings may be unsupported by your particular browser and therefore ignored.==请注意，每个浏览器的行为都不同：您的特定浏览器可能不支持某些设置，因此会被忽略。
If you are really concerned about privacy, please check what is really sent by your browser by using its embedded developer tools network console, or with the network traffic analyzer of your choice.==如果您确实担心隐私，请使用其嵌入式开发人员工具网络控制台或您选择的网络流量分析器检查浏览器实际发送的内容。
Global policy==全球政策
This referrer policy applies for every page on this peer. It is set by the "meta" HTML tag.==此引荐来源网址策略适用于该对等点上的每个页面。它由“元”HTML 标记设置。
Values are sorted by decreasing privacy level.==值按隐私级别降序排序。
no-referrer==无推荐人
Highest privacy setting: referrer information should never be sent, even when navigating on this peer internal links.==最高隐私设置：即使在该对等内部链接上导航时，也不应发送推荐人信息。
Be careful with this: some websites might reject requests with no referrer.==请注意这一点：某些网站可能会拒绝没有引荐来源网址的请求。
same-origin==同源
Peer internal links: referrer information should be stripped from any private data and contain only this peer host name.==对等内部链接：引用者信息应从任何私有数据中剥离，并仅包含此对等主机名。
External links: referrer information should never be sent.==外部链接：不应发送推荐人信息。
strict-origin==严格起源
Peer internal and external links: referrer information should be stripped from any private data and contain only this peer host name.==对等内部和外部链接：引用者信息应从任何私有数据中剥离，并仅包含此对等主机名。
Restriction: when a link downgrades from a TLS secured connection (https) on this peer to an unsecured target (http), no referrer information at all should be sent.==限制：当链接从该对等点上的 TLS 安全连接 (https) 降级到不安全的目标 (http) 时，根本不应发送引用者信息。
origin==起源
strict-origin-when-cross-origin==跨源时严格源
Peer internal links: referrer information should contain full URLs.==同行内部链接：引用者信息应包含完整的 URL。
External links: referrer information should be stripped from any private data and contain only this peer host name.==外部链接：引用者信息应从任何私有数据中剥离，并仅包含此对等主机名。
Restriction: when an external link downgrades from a TLS secured connection (https) on this peer to an unsecured target (http), no referrer information at all should be sent.==限制：当外部链接从该对等点上的 TLS 安全连接 (https) 降级到不安全的目标 (http) 时，不应发送任何引用者信息。
origin-when-cross-origin==跨原点时的原点
no-referrer-when-downgrade==降级时无推荐人
Referrer information should contain full URLs, except when a link downgrades from a TLS secured connection (https) on this peer to an unsecured target (http).==引荐来源网址信息应包含完整的 URL，除非链接从该对等方上的 TLS 安全连接 (https) 降级到不安全的目标 (http)。
empty value==空值
Default browser behavior: it should correspond to "no-referrer-when-downgrade".==默认浏览器行为：它应该对应于“no-referrer-when-downgrade”。
unsafe-url==不安全网址
Unsafe setting: referrer information should always contain full URLs.==不安全的设置：引用者信息应始终包含完整的 URL。
Custom setting: probably manually edited, be sure this value is the desired one.==自定义设置：可能是手动编辑的，请确保该值是所需的值。
Search results links==搜索结果链接
Add the "noreferrer" link type to search results links==将“noreferrer”链接类型添加到搜索结果链接
When checked, this overrides the global referrer policy and adds the standard "noreferrer"==选中后，这将覆盖全局引荐来源网址策略并添加标准“noreferrer”
thus instructing the browser that it should not send any referrer information at all when visiting them.==从而指示浏览器在访问它们时根本不应该发送任何引用者信息。
It is a standard HTML5 attribute value,==它是一个标准的 HTML5 属性值，
supported by many more browsers than the meta tag: if you want a higher level of privacy but use an old or incompatible browser,==比元标记受更多浏览器支持：如果您想要更高级别的隐私但使用旧的或不兼容的浏览器，
this can be a valuable option.==这可能是一个有价值的选择。
<em id="submitInfo">Changes will take effect immediately.</em>==<em id="submitInfo">更改将立即生效。</em>
#-----------------------------

#File: Settings_Seed.inc
#---------------------------
"Submit"=="提交"
"Retry Uploading"=="重试上传"
Seed Upload Settings==种子上传设置
With these settings you can configure if you have an account on a public accessible==如果你有一个公共服务器的账户, 可在此设置
server where you can host a seed-list file.==种子列表文件相关选项.
General Settings:==通用设置:
If you enable one of the available uploading methods, you will become a principal peer.==如果节点使用了以下某种上传方式, 则本机节点会成为主要节点.
Your peer will then upload the seed-bootstrap information periodically,==你的节点会定期上传种子启动信息,
but only if there have been changes to the seed-list.==前提是种子列表有变更.
Upload Method==上传方式
Here you can specify which upload method should be used. Select 'none' to deactivate uploading.==您可以在此处指定应使用哪种上传方法。选择“无”以停用上传。
URL==URL
The URL that can be used to retrieve the uploaded seed file, like==能够上传种子文件的链接, 比如
http://www.&lt;my-host&gt;.net/yacy/seed.txt'==http://www.&lt;my-host&gt;.net/yacy/seed.txt'
#-----------------------------

#File: Settings_Seed_UploadFile.inc
#---------------------------
"Submit"=="提交"
Store into filesystem:==存储至文件系统:
You must configure this if you want to store the seed-list file onto the file system.==如果要将seed列表文件存储至文件系统, 请先配置此选项.
File Location:==文件位置：
Here you can specify the path within the filesystem where the seed-list file should be stored.==在此指定文件系统内保存seed列表文件的路径.
current:==当前的：
#-----------------------------

#File: Settings_Seed_UploadFtp.inc
#---------------------------
"Submit"=="提交"
Uploading via FTP:==通过FTP上传:
This is the account for a FTP server where you can host a seed-list file.==此账户能够访问FTP服务器以存储seed列表文件.
If you set this, you will become a principal peer.==如果设置了此选项, 本地节点会被置为主要节点.
Your peer will then upload the seed-bootstrap information periodically,==你的节点会定期上传seed启动信息,
but only if there had been changes to the seed-list.==前提是seed列表有变更.
Server==服务器
The host where you have a FTP account, like 'ftp.&lt;my-host&gt;.net'==您拥有 FTP 帐户的主机，例如“ftp.&lt;my-host&gt;.net”
Path==路径
The remote path on the FTP server, like 'yacy/seed.txt'. Missing sub-directories are NOT created automatically.==FTP 服务器上的远程路径（例如“yacy/seed.txt'.”）不会自动创建缺少的子目录。
Username==用户名
Your log-in at the FTP server==ftp服务器用户名
Password==密码
The password==用户密码
#-----------------------------

#File: Settings_Seed_UploadScp.inc
#---------------------------
"Submit"=="提交"
Uploading via SCP:==通过SCP上传:
This is the account for a server where you are able to login via ssh.==设置通过ssh访问服务器的账户.
Server==服务器
The host where you have an account, like 'my.host.net'==服务器, 比如'my.host.net'
Server&nbsp;Port==服务器&nbsp;端口
The sshd port of the host, like '22'==ssh端口, 比如'22'
Path==路径
The remote path on the server, like '~/yacy/seed.txt'. Missing sub-directories are NOT created automatically.==ssh服务器上传路径, 比如'~/yacy/seed.txt'. 不会自动创建缺少的子目录.
Username==用户名
Your log-in at the server==ssh服务器用户名
Password==密码
The password==用户密码
